.DS_Store
*.iml
node_modules/

# loop run state (dogfooding this plugin on itself) — ignored whole, deliberately.
# This store is a demo that is rebuilt on every dogfood run, so losing it costs
# nothing; `loop-reminder` still says at session start that a Delete here cannot
# be recovered, which is true and is the right answer for a throwaway store.
# A project whose store is real should NOT copy this line — see the `.loop/*` +
# `!.loop/memory/` pattern in skills/loop-engine.
.loop/

